===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|Caiman Islands}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|es|Caymanes}}, variant of earlier {{der|en|es|Lagartos}} in reference to the early prevalence of marine and freshwater crocodiles on the islands. Spanish {{m|es|caimán}} and Portuguese {{m|pt|caimão}} are of uncertain etymology, being variously attributed to {{cog|tnq|kaimán}}, {{cog|car|acayouman}}, and {{cog|kg|-}}.

